WEBVTT

00:00:27.052 --> 00:00:28.053
(grunts)

00:02:36.473 --> 00:02:39.810
- Shh.
- (grunts)

00:02:48.485 --> 00:02:50.237
(chittering)

00:03:33.906 --> 00:03:34.907
Professor?
博士？

00:03:58.597 --> 00:04:01.683
- I have to find him.
- You don't have time.
我得找到他
你没有时间了

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:05.646
- You need to get the gate open.
- You wouldn't be here without him.
你得去打开大门
没有他你根本到不了这里

00:04:05.729 --> 00:04:07.147
And neither would I.
我也一样

00:04:10.275 --> 00:04:13.070
You and I can deal with Miraz.
你和我可以对付米拉兹

00:04:13.153 --> 00:04:15.322
And I can still get to the gate in time.
我还是可以及时打开大门

00:04:40.889 --> 00:04:44.476
- Yes, I'm a mouse. Hyah!
- (grunts)
对 我是一只老鼠

00:05:03.161 --> 00:05:06.915
Ah! We were expecting someone,
you know, taller.
我们以为来的人个子会高一点

00:05:06.999 --> 00:05:11.044
- You're one to talk.
- Is that supposed to be irony?
我比你高
这算是讽刺吗？

00:05:19.678 --> 00:05:22.347
Five more minutes?
再睡五分钟？

00:05:22.431 --> 00:05:25.017
What are you doing here?
你在这里干嘛？

00:05:26.602 --> 00:05:30.397
I didn't help you escape just
so you could break back in.
我帮你逃
不是为了让你闯入这里

00:05:31.273 --> 00:05:32.941
You have to get out
你得在米拉兹

00:05:33.025 --> 00:05:35.485
before Miraz learns you're here.
发现你之前离开

00:05:35.569 --> 00:05:38.322
He's going to learn soon enough.
他很快就会知道的

00:05:38.405 --> 00:05:40.032
We are giving him your cell.
我们要把你的牢房给他住

00:05:42.242 --> 00:05:45.370
Don't underestimate Miraz
as your father did.
别像你父亲一样低估了米拉兹

00:05:46.997 --> 00:05:48.999
What are you talking about?
你说什么？

00:05:50.292 --> 00:05:52.169
I'm sorry.
对不起

00:06:09.019 --> 00:06:13.857
(chuckles) Thank goodness you're safe.
感谢老天你没事

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.233
Get up.
起来

00:06:20.614 --> 00:06:22.366
- (Prunaprismia) Caspian?
- Stay where you are.
凯斯宾？
别乱动

00:06:22.449 --> 00:06:25.994
- What are you doing?
- I should think it's obvious, dear.
你这是干嘛？
我想这很明显

00:06:26.078 --> 00:06:30.082
Some families might consider
this inappropriate behavior.
有些亲族会认为这举动不恰当

00:06:30.165 --> 00:06:32.376
That doesn't seem
to have stopped you!
那也没能阻止你

00:06:32.459 --> 00:06:34.628
But you are not like me,
are you?
不过你不像我 对吧？

00:06:36.463 --> 00:06:40.258
It's sad. The first time
you've shown any backbone...
真可惜 你第一次这么有骨气

00:06:40.342 --> 00:06:41.802
...and it's such a waste.
却只是白费力气

00:06:45.013 --> 00:06:47.849
Put the sword down, Caspian.
把剑放下 凯斯宾

00:06:47.933 --> 00:06:52.813
- I don't want to do this.
- We don't want you to either.
我不想这么做
我们也不会让你这么做

00:06:57.984 --> 00:06:59.569
This used to be a private room.
这里本来是私人房间

00:06:59.653 --> 00:07:02.906
What are you doing? You're
supposed to be in the gatehouse!
你在干嘛？你该去开门的

00:07:02.989 --> 00:07:05.075
No!
不！

00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:07.994
Tonight for once, I want the truth.
就只有今晚 我要真相

00:07:09.663 --> 00:07:11.498
Did you kill my father?
你真的杀了我父亲？

00:07:16.169 --> 00:07:17.921
Now we get to it.
这下我懂了

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:21.133
You said your brother
died in his sleep.
你说过你哥哥是死于睡梦中

00:07:21.216 --> 00:07:23.135
That was more or less true.
那多少也算事实

00:07:23.218 --> 00:07:26.388
Caspian, this won't
make things any better.
凯斯宾 这不会有任何帮助

00:07:26.471 --> 00:07:29.474
We Telmarines would have
nothing had we not taken it.
我们坦摩人有好东西就抢

00:07:29.558 --> 00:07:31.810
Your father knew that
as well as anyone.
你父亲也很清楚这点

00:07:32.728 --> 00:07:34.312
How could you?
你怎么可以？

00:07:34.396 --> 00:07:36.857
For the same reason
you will pull that trigger.
为了相同的理由
你该扣下板机

00:07:38.024 --> 00:07:39.985
- For our son.
- Stop!
为了我们的儿子
住手

00:07:40.068 --> 00:07:42.904
- Stay right there.
- You need to make a choice, dear.
别乱动
你得做出选择

00:07:42.988 --> 00:07:45.282
Do you want our child to be king?
你要我们的孩子成为国王吗？

00:07:45.365 --> 00:07:48.368
Or do you want him
to be like Caspian here?
还是你想让他跟凯斯宾一样？

00:07:51.538 --> 00:07:54.082
- Fatherless!
- No!
没有父亲？

00:07:54.166 --> 00:07:56.126
- Caspian!
- Agh!
凯斯宾

00:07:57.502 --> 00:07:59.838
(screaming)

